dashboard-driveHealth-title = 硬碟健康狀態
dashboard-driveHealth-error = 無法讀取硬碟健康狀態：{ $message }
dashboard-driveHealth-loading = 正在讀取硬碟健康狀態…
dashboard-driveHealth-unknownStatus = 未知
